{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "efb8506f5f4f70e246ab0c882d30e3015a1fdbce787525ed2161f7f365e9e345", "ja": "ハートビートは止まらない！", "zh": "心跳永不停歇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "df56d4c42e76754020d04347180ec606a3e346808088599a302c5d97b86d6752", "ja": "茜と奈緒がプロデュースした\nイベントの盛り上がりは最高潮！\nスペシャルステージを控え、\nワクワクが抑えきれない\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "茜和奈绪制作的\n活动气氛达到了最高潮！\n这是在特别舞台开始前，\n兴奋得难以抑制的\n偶像们的一个片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de3b84374cb5771756574423e4eee4f042fd08d9a7b8ae2deba1e93bfea1ca96", "ja": "（茜と奈緒がプロデュースしたイベントが始まった。\nこの後は、アイドル達によるスペシャルステージだ！）", "zh": "（茜和奈绪负责制作的活动开始了。\n接下来就是偶像们的特别舞台了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b8ff32b419c0898a40b1f3878c1b79a01e71715403d52ee9b2f152fd5780d79e", "ja": "あっ、いた……{$P$}さん！\n今、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "啊，找到了……{$P$}先生！\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a7934f772159d569c6b1c64af7289889f360274e3b5977f584fc737888deead1", "ja": "風花、それにみんなも……？\nそんなに急いで、何か問題でもあったか？", "zh": "风花，还有大家也在……？这么着急，是出什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "79a9fb0593163cb3f8a8c9477ae5b3dc7dc597da55ff6cae1385bd1b06cb33d7", "ja": "ノープロブレムですよ！　アカネたちの今回の衣装、\nビビッドでクリエイティブで、マーベラスです！", "zh": "没问题哦！茜她们这次的服装，鲜艳又有创意，真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "159519c50de28dcac83736e3f97da8f7421852409d68da4d3a0115f2c354918f", "ja": "それならよかった。\nみんなも、よく似合ってるぞ！", "zh": "那就好。大家穿着也都很合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "0713b6655aa3a70e5dbed44b6192918e9bf337ef2ba6465606aeb4969816badd", "ja": "うっうー！　ありがとうございまーす！\nカッコイイ衣装で、なんだかドキドキしちゃいますね！", "zh": "呜—呜—！谢谢您——！\n服装好帅气，总觉得让人有些心跳加速呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "2266cc50168f0d967c0dd6d7e504f851c7d098bfce48bc53ca843a0c9ef92e72", "ja": "ありさもです。大胆にさらされた、アイドルちゃん達の\nお腹……くうぅ！　ごちそうさまです……っ！", "zh": "亚利沙也是。偶像们大胆露出的\n小肚子……唔呜！真是大饱眼福了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "825e734e23d1a33a851ffb9b2dba950026295559e47c125f9939090921d41730", "ja": "えっと、亜利沙ちゃんも同じアイドルなんだけど……\nって、違うんです！　それどころじゃなくて！", "zh": "那个，亚利沙也是偶像来着……\n不对！现在不是说这个的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "5ab33286049a4d269139e8c3bbc230d9483b42a401ad3d9d6eb7614e8a7011f2", "ja": "そ、そうでした！　あの、{$P$}。\n奈緒さんと茜さんが、大変なことになってて……。", "zh": "对、对哦！那个，{$P$}。\n奈绪姐姐和茜姐姐她们，出大事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "16d8edc601b14e40712714d80e9e44267ad54a63de32b3356f2e9732f6dd7d34", "ja": "茜ちゃん的には、ここはドローンを使いたいなぁ。\n絶対超イケてる演出になると思うんだよね～！", "zh": "在小茜看来，我想在这里用无人机。\n我觉得绝对会成为超酷的演出～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "8fb36109e7efe7a005aa66e546138a2e2aa007ec58ea208555b9c6fcd27a61da", "ja": "メッチャええやん！　ならそのドローンで、\nお客さんに、タコ焼き配れるんとちゃう？", "zh": "太棒了吧！那用那架无人机，不就能给客人发章鱼烧了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "908162e700004e24d5635861ef0d17304b731626035b1148ad6f43910e30c719", "ja": "いいね～。茜ちゃん人形もおまけにつけちゃおう！\nあ、どうせならお好み焼きセットも作っちゃう？", "zh": "不错呢～。把小茜人偶也当作赠品附上吧！\n啊，既然这样要不要干脆做个什锦烧套餐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "96c63faa5925faf25fa95538ad176309ba4476aad73df1ff76d026e4e6fe2bad", "ja": "茜、それ……メッチャすごいアイディアやん……！\nそしたら、客席におっきな鉄板用意してもらって……。", "zh": "茜，那……真是个超级棒的主意啊……！\n这样的话，就请观众席那边准备一块大大的铁板……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cb2d805efcaf6b008d98ea83c4f58a8c0330fe2d246b49955df08d17dc425008", "ja": "………………。\n随分盛り上がってるみたいだな、ふたりとも……。", "zh": "………………。\n你们两个……聊得很起劲嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "b6b9b18a28e9d96d0111a7a0365cd56af9256ec3d2c1962cdd5eed4536820a5d", "ja": "ソーリーです、{$P$}……。\nロコたちでは、ストップできませんでした。", "zh": "抱歉，{$P$}……光凭ROCO他们，也没能阻止下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "c78fb7bfe5e5d4a211c07b0859de9dfbaf41cc11c48f565b0f12b75257efce5e", "ja": "どれも魅力的なアイディアですが……\n本番まで、もうほとんど時間がありませんね。", "zh": "每个想法都很有吸引力，不过……\n距离正式演出已经没多少时间了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "71e7e3abe4cb7f7d10e9d13fc93e3a7ab5994ab38202231a30cb274a821d7393", "ja": "そうだな。本番も近いし、そろそろ止めるか。\nちょっと行ってくるよ！", "zh": "是啊。正式演出也快到了，也该差不多停下来了。\n我去一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0a927b5e6d5b4bb453b107ecfa6fe6d3f7c73e58adc514b32535925d6344c480", "ja": "奈緒、茜、お疲れさま。\n盛り上がってるところ悪いけど……。", "zh": "奈绪、茜，辛苦了。\n虽然打扰你们正起劲有些不好意思，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "23ba4d2583910d3c2861908d55a6da515c415147bbdabcf10701bc4fb272a4f2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ちょうどいいところに！\nあの、今からおっきな鉄板、用意できませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你来得正好！\n那个，现在能准备一块大铁板吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "f9acedbf4d907127055971546c59d0ec38b3ffecc82d261494343b5880805a18", "ja": "妥協して、ホットプレートでもいいです！　お客さんに\n粉モン焼きながら見てもらったら、どうかなって。", "zh": "退一步讲，电热烤盘也行！我想着要是能边给客人\n做铁板烧边让他们看，会不会挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "427f546f8fb249788990bb1ec9b610afb5ab2a9142f573a48d905e985700ef37", "ja": "それと、ドローンの手配もヨロシク☆\n茜ちゃん人形付きたこ焼きを配るのに使うからね！", "zh": "另外，无人机的安排也拜托啦☆  \n要用来分发带有小茜人偶的章鱼烧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5be2d168155d9d534462f4c145f2cf8cc5b627ed7731a7375746b7d96509763a", "ja": "面白い案だけど、却下だ！\n企画を考える前に、大切な事を忘れてないか？", "zh": "想法很有趣，但驳回！在考虑企划之前，你是不是忘了什么重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "20a49526b4172ad53d8e628fb0eb256ae9b5861ad439beefa77dc76b350a588c", "ja": "食材の買い出し？", "zh": "去采购食材？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "1b8212c3c7079c9b5585c07c4ae48c0bba2585a3d12d02951be1af20b711015b", "ja": "ドローンを飛ばす許可？", "zh": "放飞无人机的许可？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "67e1fb48e725fd1f85ab1ade655340b974b961b2a1bc904560d73f9a7cbfd8ba", "ja": "どっちも違う！\nふたりとも、もうすぐ本番だって覚えてるよな？", "zh": "都不对！\n你们两个应该记得，马上就要正式演出了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "2371ecd7f01000917824bbbf881e7e77601e5f52c6f3e947e65091f2f2dffb74", "ja": "も、もちろん覚えてるよ？　やだな～。\nこの後、みんなでステージに立つんだよね！", "zh": "当、当然记得啦！讨厌啦～\n待会儿大家要一起登台对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "6bc4b9f10e8d44d7451fb2f124227d1e7dbff58a83d0d5813c2a2f7c8ef1ea71", "ja": "新しい衣装で、テンションが上がっちゃってつい……\nなーんてことはないから安心して！　ホントだよ！", "zh": "可没有“因为换上新服装太兴奋，一不留神就……”\n这回事啦，放心吧！是真的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "2ed32dd8ae77b0dc95b2ce247e9adfb8a6abf037e4cfe7e19e75222f315f001c", "ja": "でもでも、茜さんの気持ちすっごくわかりますー！\n衣装、とってもステキですから！", "zh": "可是可是，我特别能理解茜姐的心情！因为这套服装真的太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "44646ba59ce9d86c4aead5d95b7268a3041dd17e9e767e614e1893153818b17d", "ja": "せやな。衣装もそうやし、このイベントは\n茜と一緒にずっと準備してきたからなぁ。", "zh": "是啊。服装也是，而且这个活动我一直都和茜一起准备，准备了好久呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "8c9b24e9f406a7afd098a4ab3ea164ef6584321722b95c401b74a7f1e40a9e81", "ja": "いざステージってなると、なんやソワソワして……。\nおしゃべりが止まらんようになって。えへへ♪", "zh": "真要上台了，不知怎么总觉得静不下心来……\n话也停不下来了。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f2eaedcbf10a7dfff2a51834b59a23aa95d116a466a664517da47dfb54937b75", "ja": "まぁ、テンションが高いのはいいことだけどな。\nそのソワソワは、ステージで思いっきり発散してくれ！", "zh": "不过，情绪高涨倒是件好事。\n那份静不下来的劲头，就留到舞台上尽情释放吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "59ea3e6b735c3f6842f23c8b296224afdacafdb534ab4dc65235811878704c90", "ja": "茜と奈緒だけじゃない、みんなが一緒なんだ。\n特殊な演出に頼らなくても、盛り上げられるはずだ！", "zh": "不只是茜和奈绪，大家都会一起上。就算不依靠特殊演出，也应该能把气氛带动起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_115_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_115_fc_01_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "ef1d90275209ad4b0f54e0b5a5e9839825440134b691d28b15a06b7a8823f7b1", "ja": "以心伝心だね、{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんはそれが言いたくて、ボケてたのです。", "zh": "心有灵犀呢，{$P$}！\n小茜就是想说这个，所以才故意装傻的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
